  "key": 8630,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_1114_SR212A_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "The owner of Amity Square also\n",
        "owns the Pokémon Mansion!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1114_SR212A_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "There are good trees that you can\n",
        "smear with Honey, and some you can’t.\r",
        "If you want to lure rare Pokémon,\n",
        "you have to find an attractive tree."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1114_SR212A_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Why, hello there!\r",
        "It’s nice to have an average citizen\n",
        "say hi to us Policemen!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1114_SR212A_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Patrols day and night...\n",
        "I’m feeling drowsy... Yawn..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1114_SR212A_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Yo!\n",
        "Working hard at it, Trainer?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1114_SR212A_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Just between you and me...\n",
        "I think we’re on patrol too much."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1114_SR212A_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 212\n",
        "Hearthome City"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1114_SR212A_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon Mansion\n",
        "For Pokémon Viewings"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1114_SR212A_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips\r",
        "The items in the Bag can be\n",
        "reorganized by pressing SELECT."
      ]
    }
  ]
}